{"translation":{"id":"BSB","name":"Berean Standard Bible","website":"https://berean.bible/","licenseUrl":"https://berean.bible/","license":{"attribution":"not-required","commercialUse":"allowed","derivatives":"allowed","copyleft":false,"publicDomain":true},"shortName":"BSB","englishName":"Berean Standard Bible","language":"eng","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"6cc5238e442b4204b0f617cc5c932bc04f3bae4a0658e6393b0e319653ebe37f","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/BSB/books.json","completeTranslationApiLink":"/api/BSB/complete.json","simpleCompleteTranslationApiLink":"/api/BSB/complete.simple.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31086,"languageName":"English","languageEnglishName":"English"},"book":{"id":"PHP","name":"Philippians","commonName":"Philippians","title":"Philippians","numberOfChapters":4,"totalNumberOfVerses":104},"chapters":[null,{"numberOfVerses":30,"thisChapterAudioLinks":{"david":"https://audio.bible.helloao.org/api/BSB/PHP/1/audio/david.mp3","gilbert":"https://openbible.com/audio/gilbert/BSB_50_Php_001_G.mp3","hays":"https://audio.bible.helloao.org/api/BSB/PHP/1/audio/hays.mp3","souer":"https://audio.bible.helloao.org/api/BSB/PHP/1/audio/souer.mp3"},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["Greetings from Paul and Timothy"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["Paul and Timothy, servants of Christ Jesus,",{"lineBreak":true},"To all the saints in Christ Jesus at Philippi, together with the overseers and deacons:"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["Grace and peace to you from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ."]},{"type":"heading","content":["Thanksgiving and Prayer"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["I thank my God every time I remember you."]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["In every prayer for all of you, I always pray with joy,"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["because of your partnership in the gospel from the first day until now,"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["being confident of this, that He who began a good work in you will carry it on to completion until the day of Christ Jesus."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["It is right for me to feel this way about all of you, since I have you in my heart. For in my chains and in my defense and confirmation of the gospel, you are all partners in grace with me."]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["God is my witness how I long for all of you with the affection of Christ Jesus."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["And this is my prayer: that your love may abound more and more in knowledge and depth of insight,"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["so that you may be able to test and prove what is best and may be pure and blameless for the day of Christ,"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["filled with the fruit of righteousness that comes through Jesus Christ, to the glory and praise of God."]},{"type":"heading","content":["Paul’s Trials Advance the Gospel"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["Now I want you to know, brothers, that my circumstances have actually served to advance the gospel."]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["As a result, it has become clear throughout the whole palace guard",{"noteId":0},"and to everyone else that I am in chains for Christ."]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["And most of the brothers, confident in the Lord by my chains, now dare more greatly to speak the word",{"noteId":1},"without fear."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["It is true that some preach Christ out of envy and rivalry, but others out of goodwill."]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["The latter do so in love, knowing that I am appointed for the defense of the gospel.",{"noteId":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["The former, however, preach Christ out of selfish ambition, not sincerely, supposing that they can add to the distress of my chains."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["What then is the issue?",{"noteId":3},"Just this: that in every way, whether by false motives or true, Christ is preached. And in this I rejoice. Yes, and I will continue to rejoice,"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["because I know that through your prayers and the provision of the Spirit of Jesus Christ, my distress will turn out for my deliverance."]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["I eagerly expect and hope that I will in no way be ashamed, but will have complete boldness so that now as always Christ will be exalted in my body, whether by life or by death."]},{"type":"heading","content":["To Live Is Christ"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["For to me, to live is Christ, and to die is gain."]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["But if I go on living in the body, this will mean fruitful labor for me. So what shall I choose? I do not know."]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["I am torn between the two. I desire to depart and be with Christ, which is far better indeed."]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["But it is more necessary for you that I remain in the body."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["Convinced of this, I know that I will remain and will continue with all of you for your progress and joy in the faith,"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["so that through my coming to you again your exultation in Christ Jesus will resound on account of me."]},{"type":"heading","content":["Worthy of the Gospel"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["Nevertheless, conduct yourselves in a manner worthy of the gospel of Christ. Then, whether I come and see you or only hear about you in my absence, I will know that you stand firm in one spirit, contending together as one",{"noteId":4},"for the faith of the gospel,"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["without being frightened in any way by those who oppose you. This is a clear sign of their destruction but of your salvation, and it is from God."]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["For it has been granted to you on behalf of Christ not only to believe in Him, but also to suffer for Him,"]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["since you are encountering the same struggle you saw I had, and now hear that I still have."]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"Or all the Praetorium","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":13}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"NE and WH the word of God","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":14}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"BYZ and TR reverse the order of verses 16 and 17.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":16}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"Literally What then?","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":18}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"Or striving together with one mind","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":27}}]}},{"numberOfVerses":30,"thisChapterAudioLinks":{"david":"https://audio.bible.helloao.org/api/BSB/PHP/2/audio/david.mp3","gilbert":"https://openbible.com/audio/gilbert/BSB_50_Php_002_G.mp3","hays":"https://audio.bible.helloao.org/api/BSB/PHP/2/audio/hays.mp3","souer":"https://audio.bible.helloao.org/api/BSB/PHP/2/audio/souer.mp3"},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["One in Christ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["Therefore if you have any encouragement in Christ, if any comfort from His love, if any fellowship with the Spirit, if any affection and compassion,"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["then make my joy complete by being like-minded, having the same love, being united in spirit and purpose."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["Do nothing out of selfish ambition or empty pride, but in humility consider others more important than yourselves."]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["Each of you should look not only to your own interests, but also to the interests of others."]},{"type":"heading","content":["The Mind of Christ"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["Let this mind be in you which was also in Christ Jesus:"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Who, existing in the form of God,","poem":1},{"text":"did not consider equality with God","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"something to be grasped,","poem":2},{"noteId":5}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"but emptied Himself,","poem":1},{"text":"taking the form of a servant,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"being made in human likeness.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"And being found in appearance as a man,","poem":1},{"text":"He humbled Himself","poem":2},{"text":"and became obedient to death—","poem":1},{"text":"even death on a cross.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"Therefore God exalted Him to the highest place","poem":1},{"text":"and gave Him the name above all names,","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"that at the name of Jesus every knee should bow,","poem":1},{"text":"in heaven and on earth and under the earth,","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"and every tongue confess that Jesus Christ is Lord,","poem":1},{"text":"to the glory of God the Father.","poem":2}]},{"type":"heading","content":["Lights in the World"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["Therefore, my beloved, just as you have always obeyed, not only in my presence, but now even more in my absence, continue to work out your salvation with fear and trembling."]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["For it is God who works in you to will and to act on behalf of His good purpose."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["Do everything without complaining or arguing,"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["so that you may be blameless and pure, children of God without fault in a crooked and perverse generation,",{"noteId":6},"in which you shine as lights in the world"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["as you hold forth the word of life, in order that I may boast on the day of Christ that I did not run or labor in vain."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["But even if I am being poured out like a drink offering on the sacrifice and service of your faith, I am glad and rejoice with all of you."]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["So you too should be glad and rejoice with me."]},{"type":"heading","content":["Timothy and Epaphroditus"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["Now I hope in the Lord Jesus to send Timothy to you soon, that I also may be cheered when I learn how you are doing."]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["I have nobody else like him who will genuinely care for your needs."]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["For all the others look after their own interests, not those of Jesus Christ."]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["But you know Timothy’s proven worth, that as a child with his father he has served with me to advance the gospel."]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["So I hope to send him as soon as I see what happens with me."]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["And I trust in the Lord that I myself will come soon."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["But I thought it necessary to send back to you Epaphroditus, my brother, fellow worker, and fellow soldier, who is also your messenger and minister to my needs."]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["For he has been longing for all of you and is distressed because you heard he was ill."]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["He was sick indeed, nearly unto death. But God had mercy on him, and not only on him but also on me, to spare me sorrow upon sorrow."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["Therefore I am all the more eager to send him, so that when you see him again you may rejoice, and I may be less anxious."]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["Welcome him in the Lord with great joy, and honor men like him,"]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["because he nearly died for the work of Christ, risking his life to make up for your deficit of service to me."]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"Or something to be exploited","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":6}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"Deuteronomy 32:5","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":15}}]}},{"numberOfVerses":21,"thisChapterAudioLinks":{"david":"https://audio.bible.helloao.org/api/BSB/PHP/3/audio/david.mp3","gilbert":"https://openbible.com/audio/gilbert/BSB_50_Php_003_G.mp3","hays":"https://audio.bible.helloao.org/api/BSB/PHP/3/audio/hays.mp3","souer":"https://audio.bible.helloao.org/api/BSB/PHP/3/audio/souer.mp3"},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["Righteousness through Faith in Christ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["Finally, my brothers, rejoice in the Lord. It is no trouble for me to write the same things to you again, and it is a safeguard for you."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["Watch out for those dogs, those workers of evil, those mutilators of the flesh!"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["For it is we who are the circumcision, we who worship by the Spirit of God, who glory in Christ Jesus, and who put no confidence in the flesh—"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["though I myself could have such confidence.",{"lineBreak":true},"If anyone else thinks he has grounds for confidence in the flesh, I have more:"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["circumcised on the eighth day, of the people of Israel, of the tribe of Benjamin; a Hebrew of Hebrews; as to the law, a Pharisee;"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["as to zeal, persecuting the church; as to righteousness in the law, faultless."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["But whatever was gain to me I count as loss for the sake of Christ."]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["More than that, I count all things as loss compared to the surpassing excellence of knowing Christ Jesus my Lord, for whom I have lost all things. I consider them rubbish, that I may gain Christ"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["and be found in Him, not having my own righteousness from the law, but that which is through faith in Christ,",{"noteId":7},"the righteousness from God on the basis of faith."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["I want to know Christ and the power of His resurrection and the fellowship of His sufferings, being conformed to Him in His death,"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["and so, somehow, to attain to the resurrection from the dead."]},{"type":"heading","content":["Pressing on toward the Goal"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["Not that I have already obtained all this, or have already been made perfect, but I press on to take hold of that for which Christ Jesus took hold of me."]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["Brothers, I do not consider myself yet to have taken hold of it. But one thing I do: Forgetting what is behind and straining toward what is ahead,"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["I press on toward the goal to win the prize of God’s heavenly calling in Christ Jesus."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["All of us who are mature should embrace this point of view. And if you think differently about some issue, God will reveal this to you as well."]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["Nevertheless, we must live up to what we have already attained."]},{"type":"heading","content":["Citizenship in Heaven"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["Join one another in following my example, brothers, and carefully observe those who walk according to the pattern we set for you."]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["For as I have often told you before, and now say again even with tears: Many live as enemies of the cross of Christ."]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["Their end is destruction, their god is their belly, and their glory is in their shame. Their minds are set on earthly things."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["But our citizenship is in heaven, and we eagerly await a Savior from there, the Lord Jesus Christ,"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["who, by the power that enables Him to subject all things to Himself, will transform our lowly bodies to be like His glorious body."]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"Or through the faithfulness of Christ","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":9}}]}},{"numberOfVerses":23,"thisChapterAudioLinks":{"david":"https://audio.bible.helloao.org/api/BSB/PHP/4/audio/david.mp3","gilbert":"https://openbible.com/audio/gilbert/BSB_50_Php_004_G.mp3","hays":"https://audio.bible.helloao.org/api/BSB/PHP/4/audio/hays.mp3","souer":"https://audio.bible.helloao.org/api/BSB/PHP/4/audio/souer.mp3"},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["Rejoice in the Lord"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["Therefore, my brothers, whom I love and long for, my joy and crown, that is how you must stand firm in the Lord, my beloved."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["I urge Euodia and Syntyche to agree with each other in the Lord."]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["Yes, and I ask you, my true yokefellow,",{"noteId":8},"to help these women who have contended at my side for the gospel, along with Clement and the rest of my fellow workers, whose names are in the Book of Life."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["Rejoice in the Lord always. I will say it again: Rejoice!"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["Let your gentleness be apparent to all. The Lord is near."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["Be anxious for nothing, but in everything, by prayer and petition, with thanksgiving, present your requests to God."]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["And the peace of God, which surpasses all understanding, will guard your hearts and your minds in Christ Jesus."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["Finally, brothers, whatever is true, whatever is honorable, whatever is right, whatever is pure, whatever is lovely, whatever is admirable—if anything is excellent or praiseworthy—think on these things."]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["Whatever you have learned or received or heard from me, or seen in me, put it into practice. And the God of peace will be with you."]},{"type":"heading","content":["The Generosity of the Philippians"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["Now I rejoice greatly in the Lord that at last you have revived your concern for me. You were indeed concerned, but you had no opportunity to show it."]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["I am not saying this out of need, for I have learned to be content regardless of my circumstances."]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["I know how to live humbly, and I know how to abound. In any and every situation I have learned the secret of being filled and being hungry, of having plenty and having need."]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["I can do all things through Christ who gives me strength.",{"noteId":9}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["Nevertheless, you have done well to share in my affliction."]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["And as you Philippians know, in the early days of the gospel, when I left Macedonia, no church but you partnered with me in the matter of giving and receiving."]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["For even while I was in Thessalonica, you provided for my needs again and again."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["Not that I am seeking a gift, but I am looking for the fruit that may be credited to your account."]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["I have all I need and more, now that I have received your gifts from Epaphroditus. They are a fragrant offering, an acceptable sacrifice, well-pleasing to God."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["And my God will supply all your needs according to His glorious riches in Christ Jesus."]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["To our God and Father be glory forever and ever. Amen."]},{"type":"heading","content":["Final Greetings"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["Greet all the saints in Christ Jesus.",{"lineBreak":true},"The brothers who are with me send you greetings."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["All the saints send you greetings, especially those from the household of Caesar."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["The grace of the Lord Jesus Christ be with your spirit.",{"noteId":10}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"Or I ask you, loyal Syzygus","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":3}},{"noteId":9,"caller":"+","text":"NA, SBL, NE, and WH in the One who gives me strength. BYZ and TR in Christ who gives me strength.","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":13}},{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"BYZ and TR include Amen.","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":23}}]}}]}
